  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuberculosis Prevention and Control for Vulnerable Populations - Myanmar (01-Jan-2021-31-Dec-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar, Tuberculosis, Save the Children Federation, Inc. (STC HQ)This program has the following goals: End the TB epidemic in Myanmar (Fewer than 10 cases per 100,000 population by 2035) 50% reduction of TB incidence compared with 2015 baseline by 2025. The objectives of this program are: Expand TB services as part of Universal Health Coverage and strengthen partnerships.  Minimize TB transmission by intensifying efforts on prevention and reaching high-risk populations.  Achieve a faster decline in TB burden through an accelerated multisectoral TB response</narrative>
  </description>
